  "theorem": "For every original ABI input x and every906168-word new MR tape R, candidate scored coordinates equal original scored coordinates at(x,pi(R)), where pi deletes exactly these12 cleanup words. This follows by induction through unchanged outside operations, source-proved clean-carry preconditions, arbitrary other-q entry restoration, and arbitrary-entry classical/snapshot equality. All MR words, including inactive events, are quantified.",
